# The Coldhold Vault (CIPlay coldhold_vault): the entrance, the charter, the power, the zipline to the far side, Oda's
# cage and pack, her notes, the screechers; the seed wing's canisters, the record wing's papers, the embryo wing's crank
# and the keeper's code; the control room, one switch (CARRY), the verdict, the gift, Hedda's call, the flood door.
island The Coldhold Vault
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -22; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 22
expect step 0
expect title Beneath the Glacier
expect hidden carrychest
expect hidden heddacall
zone entrance
expect step 1
read Coldhold charter
expect step 2
use powerlever
expect story power 1
expect step 3
open Keeper's hooks
wait 3
zone far_side
expect step 4
use odacage
expect survivor frozen_oda
open Oda's pack
wait 3
expect step 5
read Oda's notes
expect step 6
kill Screecher
expect step 7
zone seed_wing
expect step 8
openat -9.2 9.6
openat -13.2 8.8
openat -12.8 2.4
wait 2
expect story canister 3
expect step 9
zone record_wing
expect step 10
read Founders' record
open Council box
expect story councilcode 0
code councilpad 1909
expect story councilcode 1
open Council box
wait 3
expect step 11
read Why the comms went off
expect step 12
zone embryo_wing
expect step 13
use coolcrank
expect story cooling 1
expect step 14
read Keeper's last entry
expect step 15
# DEEP 10-24: M14 - the interlock plate, the catalogue boards, the timed terminal run (snowflake, leaf, drop)
read Control door interlock
expect step 16
read Seed catalogue
read Record catalogue
code term2 5081
expect shown controldoor
code term1 1111 wrong
code term1 3317
wait 4
expect shown coldrun
code term2 5081
code term3 2240
expect hidden controldoor
expect hidden coldrun
expect step 17
zone control
expect step 18
read The Warden's ledger
expect step 19
read Sparks' QSL card
read Three switches
expect step 20
use carrylever
expect story choice 1
expect shown carrychest
expect shown heddacall
expect hidden keepchest
expect step 21
read The verdict
expect step 22
open The vault's gift
wait 3
expect step 23
read Hedda's radio call
expect step 24
# DEEP 10-24: the flood door has no interlock - the vent keeper's cave, the ice cap, the vent shaft
use floodlever
expect shown flooddoor
zone cap_foot
open Vent keeper's bedroll
read Vent keeper's note
expect step 25
zone vent_top
expect step 26
open Vent shaft chest
expect story interlock 1
# (no "expect step 27": in the plan the flood-door zone step can be done already)
zone flood_door
expect step 28
use floodlever
expect hidden flooddoor
expect done
# the extras: the flooded crevasse dive, two treasures
zone flooded_crevasse
air crevair
open Survey boat's strongbox
dig 0
dig 1
dig 2
dig 3
